	"data": "XR & Spatial Computing — Current State\n\nLiving document. Updated weekly by the Wednesday XR news sweep.\n\nOpenXR\n\nCurrent spec: OpenXR 1.1 (ratified). Registry at registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.1/.\n\nSpatial Entities Extensions (June 2025)\nThe big one. Ratified after 2+ years of cross-vendor design. First open standard for portable spatial computing:\nPlane and marker detection/tracking\nPrecise spatial anchors\nCross-session persistence (content survives between XR sessions)\nRon Bessems (WG…",
